  "description": "Ryu Ho-Kyung and Baek Hee-Won, who are like enemies, are trapped in a suspicious cave one day. To make matters worse, the cave is filled with a sexual scent, and if things continue this way, their danjeon is in danger of being destroyed.......\n\n *“Let’s just solve it among ourselves. We just need to calm down anyway.”\n\n“You crazy bastard! Come to your senses, Ryu Ho-Kyung!”\n\n“Hee-Won, relax a bit. Be nice. I’m just doing this to make you feel better.”*\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
